{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_026_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:80921d109ec3c58de1aa65aa6f18f9043bc53f700e0fcaddbbc6a0fe9dac491d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cac45d4178eafec3965308c9acf485d42c67acbca163ba18cc2b7e39c432f5c6",
      "text": "玩具店·店内",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fa8dce594fb65dac7ab6c749e226e74c79dff880b86ecaf388d3d79351462da",
      "text": "这一带是毛绒玩具区啊。\n动物毛绒玩具大家都会喜欢的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ad8023bd7a6b2bffa2b4fe4a88693f1936fd97547aba7f1a9d2842b971b772a",
      "text": "哇，种类好多啊。有绵羊、有小狗，\n这个是……耳廓狐吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd01f6a8d2a84361ff9dc3d66d84c5936a3ddaf830a3c56086a45882dbb4d71",
      "text": "嗯，是耳廓狐。这边是变色龙吗。\n……哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37d1a802acb45ad251cf145d9577ff8bcb848658c5900a71857e50a252f5e9e2",
      "text": "这个猫咪毛绒玩具，长得好像喵子啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5288d143dd3938ec08d1fcb0b7287e21d3f0e31193349580b752ea5d55cb47d",
      "text": "真的耶！\n啊，那个毛绒玩具，花音君好像会喜欢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8f57bf2b2b70d5c20fd6d987a3c72fe265143dfd35256bddc7e30baec9a8356",
      "text": "那个也买下吧。……好，毛绒玩具差不多就\n买这些吧。差不多该换个区域了，番长。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5781dd2bef54e693e3879d2bc30663abd362b954fa043ab2966d55e89a0d6634",
      "text": "玄武先生，这个怎么样？\n是现在正在播出的特摄片玩具。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de0b9f4bded2a479e08b66daeef687c384a211729f5f19e1098652a0393a68ec",
      "text": "也是啊……虽然现在挺好，但要是往后用上好些年的话，\n可能会显得有些过时了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee245153db664c9376d1fde4fb334ad478e648c48f4f78f37fd080e7b0e340e9",
      "text": "不受流行影响、能玩很久的玩具才好。\n那样对福利院也更有益处。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b94237c51428458dd0a20a4102036faeaf99ad362ac3180a3de5d379b917066b",
      "text": "原来如此，确实是这样呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da8c66c43d0f5524d624774e55139fe1ec11d4f70c92f095169231b15e9652bc",
      "text": "（玄武先生，各方面都考虑得很周全呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67de369e4dc9ccefc52f40aa53013c516ee1c10e2bed26c545106fdc30230f6d",
      "text": "你特意提了建议我还这么挑剔，抱歉啊。\n不过，多谢你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
